  "details": "If Debug UI is opened, interactable objects are blocked to interact and tooltip is not shown. Pickups and UIs are still be useable while Debug UI is opened.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Join into a world that has at least an interactable object\n\n2. Open Debug UI\n\n3. Try to interact an interactable object in world.\n\nExpected result:\n\nThe interactable object should be interact while Debug UI is opened.\n\nActual result:\n\nThe interactable object cannot be interact while Debug UI is opened, and tooltip is not shown if hovered.",
